>
>So, the message is more informational than something that might be
>a problem in the "emx" driver itself, it's a result of the driver
>asking the "name server" in the fibrechannel fabric for information
>that would normally be returned.
>
>We suspect you have an old patch kit on that system, if you have any
>patches at all.  The current patch kit for V5.1A is, I believe, PK6,
>and it's available from HP's support web site.  You don't need a new
>or update license of any kind to apply the patch kit, and having the
>current versions of drivers and so forth may help.  However, it does
>not sound like this particular error was a problem in the driver or
>host system software, but rather a transient condition in the fibre
>fabric.
>
>Hope this information helps..
>
>Tom


