"
Engineering has found the problem.  It will probably take several days for
the stuff mentioned below to be completed.

   There is a new ioctl that was added to cam
   cdisk for all devices... except the swcr (re driver) which doesn't go
through
   the cam cdisk code paths.  This ioctl is only used by drd in clustering
   configurations.  I will be adding the new ioctl to the swxcr driver
shortly to
   resolve this issue and will coordinate with cluster engineering a review
of the
   changed code.
"

