I suspect that there are some tuning issues that need to be worked through,
but I want to be sure that I'm not missing anything. Is there anything that
I should look at or maybe tell the DBAs to look at that could improve
performance?

I've already verified that system parameters are set to where Oracle
recommends.

Has anybody else done a similar upgrade and noticed any similar problems?

-Charlie



